<title>USA: U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. rice weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA rice export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 6,000 MT were 70 percent below the week earlier and the 4-week average.  The primary buyers were Canada (1,500 MT), the Netherlands (1,200 MT), and Mexico (1,100 MT, of which 700 MT was rough).</p>
<p>Sales of 5,800 MT for delivery in 1997/98 were primarily for Haiti (5,600 MT).  Exports of 17,200 MT were down 52 percent from the prior week and 29 percent under the 4-week average.  Peru (6,000 MT), the Netherlands (3,700 MT), Canada (2,600 MT), and Switzerland (1,300 MT) were the primary destinations.</p>
</text>
